{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "bf39e93d2f7f3364f808e4442e0a70db1f9142efabe77d425d66a7afdbbfd2cf", "ja": "宙ぶらりんの思い", "zh": "悬而未决的思绪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "54e461c1f69f9a006f95f6a5fb05301ea8d8c89f4781ffd53e05f29016070e1c", "ja": "新ユニットの初仕事は、音楽雑誌に掲載する\nコラムの執筆依頼だった。提示された『歌』\nというテーマに向き合うため、真剣に考え始\nめる3人。", "zh": "新组合的第一份工作，是为音乐杂志撰写专栏。  \n为了面对杂志提出的“歌曲”这一主题，开始认真思考的3人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b9555f7e842792e9c196ade846a7850d55bfba337b17d0814ccbb6549331ee95", "ja": "（新ユニットの資料を各メディアに送ったところ、\n音楽雑誌から特集したいとの連絡があった）", "zh": "（把新组合的资料发给各家媒体后，音乐杂志联系了我们，说想做一期专题）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dfc27a93b0af2cc5cd0fdf858ff51011b6a60041c3df16b77631cb8d362c9b27", "ja": "（目玉として、歌について、それぞれコラムを執筆して\nもらう……皆の思いを知ってもらう、いい機会だ！）", "zh": "（作为亮点，请大家分别围绕歌曲撰写专栏……这是让大家了解我们心意的好机会！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "2f1ace2c652b4301d11c1076b7087720d4c2fd5efde4be6b408d7ccee1184530", "ja": "ふう……もう、このような時間ですか。\n皆、少し休憩にしませんか？", "zh": "呼……已经到这个时间了吗？\n大家要不要稍微休息一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "b58d4af7663534862e78920ac6719a562578c807638ffd2873e6fc62e8f016de", "ja": "ええ、そうですね。\n初日から飛ばしても、後に響きますし。", "zh": "嗯，说得对。\n第一天就拼得太狠的话，会影响之后的状态。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1005_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5bb7af9bf80b40bef642f94c30a4ab96cb55edab8cfde11ec68b2ff96298821a", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n仕事の話があるんだけど……その前に、調子はどうだ？", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n我有些工作上的事要跟你们说……不过在那之前，状态怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9bde92fe522f2f085068a8bcf12d5add7076f39276ccea5bf5363f8ae1bbb1f0", "ja": "あずささん？\n……あずささん、どうかしましたか？", "zh": "阿梓莎小姐？\n……阿梓莎小姐，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "3940ad39d2d6c65eef81a9c4ddcb32f008dc5e43222e2155dd5e400c8075799d", "ja": "えっ？　あ、すみません。\nちょっと、ぼーっとしてしまって……。", "zh": "咦？啊，抱歉。\n刚才有点走神了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "cec0c507d857145d78fc9357adcb8879185a731d5960cd60f7180b6f7c742d87", "ja": "あずさ、もしや体調がすぐれないのではありませんか？\n歌声にも、少々力がないような……？", "zh": "阿梓莎，难道是身体不舒服吗？\n就连歌声听起来也有些无力……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "8b205a1f3fc455f60e92b0655355b7b96eb6f394b3d67b8c23012da58724f385", "ja": "私もそう感じました。\nあの、あずささん。何か……問題でも？", "zh": "我也有同样的感觉。\n那个，梓小姐。是有什么……问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "fea722aca45e43f9f8579da098f29bd4202fc2644a46458caeac784cc6db62e3", "ja": "あ……ううん、大丈夫よ。ふたりについて行くのが\n大変で、私はどう歌ったらいいのかしら……って。", "zh": "啊……不，没事哦。要跟上你们两个实在有点难，我就在想……我该怎么唱才好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "8ae3b944cd706e5a32792f5c8183c8619d7fa96d4886c82b1bc431f221059ee8", "ja": "でも、どう歌えばいいかを悩む、なんて……\nきっと、ぜいたくなことなんですよね。", "zh": "可是，居然还会烦恼该怎么唱……这一定是件奢侈的事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e545283ba7a921b757ec926ece6eca9aa866d1fddc547c010dd4ec87a34c3a26", "ja": "（あずささん……？）", "zh": "（梓小姐……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "d6d806810256f1c78d143c43f5861465ada06d7e9a6a5724be3fa976586f9256", "ja": "そういうことでしたら……。\n私達にも、悩ませてもらえますか？", "zh": "如果是这样的话……  \n也请让我们一起烦恼吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "bcc7fb42c1424a04962c3fcc38b16b37de9ec5794f976135d1c58dc8fb552522", "ja": "そうですよ、あずさ。\nユニットとして、この曲をどう仕上げていくか……。", "zh": "就是这样，梓。\n作为一个组合，要怎样完成这首歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "3402fffb625936db7a19544bf664a22f72f8cb0c3c34ddac27fe3d4c2fefa682", "ja": "それは一緒に考えようと、{$P$}も\n言っていたではありませんか。", "zh": "不是说要一起想办法吗，{$P$}不也这么说过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e0ea8934c58adfd590ea45b9c3a421760caa3fdc08b86cf11dbeacea99e8d372", "ja": "そう……貴音や千早と歌を合わせるというのは、\nたしかに、プレッシャーだと思います。", "zh": "是啊……要和贵音、千早一起合唱，确实会让人感到压力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "fc1d9d8046ca8e1a0f9f63304bde4decc0158ebe65b6ba7b3c75436801624480", "ja": "でも、二人も同じ気持ちだと思いますよ。あずささんも\n遠慮せずに堂々と、自分を出してくださいね！", "zh": "不过，我觉得她们两位也是一样的心情。あずさ小姐也请不要拘谨，大大方方地展现自己吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "daf4b20829b852f2f041b22adb0ef3653a09c0f1b89976bd6b064302169ecd56", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n千早ちゃん、貴音ちゃんも。ありがとうございます。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……千早、贵音，也谢谢你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "09a6c6d7588d29200e79a70e1db362deb809c55ffc8fc01fa3cc3734c5e8df6a", "ja": "私、悩んでなんている場合じゃありませんね。\nもっと、がんばらないと！", "zh": "我哪能一直烦恼下去呢。\n要更加努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "330d41e21eb3903bbd5cf17f78d465876be126e923cd220baa10ccf7b05f4e04", "ja": "（それから休憩時間を使って、皆はレッスンで\n気づいたことを指摘し、互いの意見をぶつけ合った）", "zh": "（之后大家利用休息时间，指出了在练习中注意到的问题，互相交换了意见）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1023_008tak", "source_sha256": "f8465a196ae0419f134010c1e28ca7d014a3e1354489d9cd5154887046f2e3d2", "ja": "私達の目指す歌への道すじが、見えて来ましたね。\nではもう一度、頭から合わせてみましょう。", "zh": "我们所追求的歌声之路，已经逐渐清晰了呢。那就再从头开始合练一次吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1024_010azu", "source_sha256": "1b4efc8df861bee585da3b00549575c09c570919b3cc9e46d655b31b457d1c21", "ja": "ええ♪", "zh": "嗯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "c1cf06aef9b03abc1e977d8070bc83dadf4f131010bf35e9bcb4c1b723c10a18", "ja": "（3人の歌声が、どんどん調和していく……\nこのユニットは、まだまだ伸びしろがあるな！）", "zh": "（3人的歌声，越来越和谐了……这个组合还有很大的成长空间啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1028_se", "source_sha256": "53fbbb16d7839d8f47fba871a27d04a54e0dcc0fa06dca36030160bc515333b6", "ja": "パチパチパチパチパチ……", "zh": "啪啪啪啪啪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "9cdfe41f5ba69c6d300ddaba8bd0550682ce5bc7f387351a9838e21be0b4b396", "ja": "あら……？", "zh": "哎呀……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "dcd2fa1f068e82ad3fe45c6c7e5a4c568437706f987416c7894f9008d94a1724", "ja": "わぁ～、すごーい！\n3人のハーモニー♪　可奈もぜっさ～ん♪", "zh": "哇～，好厉害～！\n3个人的和声♪　可奈也大赞～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1031_002chi", "source_sha256": "617fd881a1cb30d7c8639ed5f5744489c2ff87b761fcf007cc87c258d1bfca17", "ja": "矢吹さん。\nそれに、箱崎さん、高槻さんも……？", "zh": "矢吹同学。\n还有，箱崎同学、高槻同学……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "190593be53a555dc081afd909e1fd08ff66b15db21452d17198cc1e6b8911468", "ja": "わたしたち、今、お仕事から帰ってきたんです！\nそうしたら、綺麗な歌声が聞こえてきたので……。", "zh": "我们刚刚才工作回来呢！\n然后听到了优美的歌声，所以就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1033_005yay", "source_sha256": "cdf15834576f5797bcd908f89b68aa09a55956eee486e5b2b1b8031dccbda472", "ja": "とってもキレイな歌ですね！\nなんだか、星がばーって降ってきてるみたいで！", "zh": "真是动听的歌声呢！\n感觉就像星星哗啦啦地落下来一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1034_p", "source_sha256": "9e8d4271c657c853b78995fe709417fff250fd9ffcd68b98932957e82d2f6582", "ja": "星が降ってきてる……なるほど。\nいい表現だな、やよい！", "zh": "星星正在飘落……原来如此。\n这个比喻不错啊，弥生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1035_005yay", "source_sha256": "18e3d0e0b2865dfce5e4f75399da38efd02989762ad8ebe5cd6f678c8e4aaa94", "ja": "{$P$}、ほんとですか？\nえへへ……♪", "zh": "{$P$}，真的吗？\n嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1036_008tak", "source_sha256": "7d99d057b79dae0b069cf382aaf282552b3bb2061480051706a24907ac0a7bef", "ja": "いつの間にか、かわいらしい観客がいたようですね。\n……皆、私達の歌はどうでしたか？", "zh": "不知不觉间，似乎来了一位可爱的观众呢。\n……大家觉得我们的歌唱得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1037_022ser", "source_sha256": "60215fddfc8c4cc5b56938913e799df04aa3c6d1323b42bb301ae7864b4fefb0", "ja": "とってもステキでした！\nわたしも、あんな風に歌えるようになりたいです！", "zh": "非常棒！\n我也想唱得像那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1038_022ser", "source_sha256": "ff6d311e7c809fc4c0927021d928bdaced5c7008c22273a5243d4d1c072442bc", "ja": "けど……どうしたら、貴音さんや\nみなさんのように歌えるんでしょうか？", "zh": "可是……要怎么做，才能像贵音小姐和大家一样唱歌呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1039_036kan", "source_sha256": "a204fee7c850c1466da36a2337adb6dc180db4a0d578314a670f0fb1f7d16ced", "ja": "やっぱり練習～？　たくさん練習～♪\nお仕事の後でも、レッスンがんばるぞ～♪", "zh": "果然还是要练习～？多多练习～♪\n工作结束后，也要加油上课～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1040_002chi", "source_sha256": "73641dcf65b6687dcf030653cf7e9c052c774492a65eb75b1252f18b39174b78", "ja": "あ。そういえば……{$P$}。\nたしか私達にも、仕事のお話があったのでは……？", "zh": "啊，对了……{$P$}。\n我记得我们这边好像也有工作要谈……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1041_p", "source_sha256": "30e796207c32210412308dc4a9ddc0c7669c4b116a34d1e38b6058a1a41266f2", "ja": "あ、そうそう。\n実は千早たちのユニットに、仕事の依頼が来てるんだ。", "zh": "啊，对了。\n其实千早她们的组合接到了工作委托。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1042_008tak", "source_sha256": "f4a40d5f148b752a72ff1a913979ddc3cc1fa618ed1927bdac264c8cca616bc3", "ja": "仕事の依頼……ですが私達は、まだユニットを\n組んだばかりで、活動していませんが……。", "zh": "工作邀约……可是我们才刚组成组合，还没有开始活动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1043_p", "source_sha256": "abc70d639ddafbfb9af20ed86a23da04b0e6033ca4a97d391f35d2c06dac10db", "ja": "そうなんだけど、企画は色々先行してるから。CD発売\nと同時に、音楽雑誌で特集を組んでもらう予定なんだ。", "zh": "确实是这样，不过各种企划已经提前展开了。预定在CD发售的同时，请音乐杂志为我们策划专题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1044_p", "source_sha256": "aead12b3d20c89fb8b8fb7f869c728be148cd493ee1464f020e51991b0b27648", "ja": "その特集の目玉記事として、3人に、\n『歌』をテーマにしたコラムを書いてほしいそうだ。", "zh": "作为那期特辑的重头文章，他们希望由3人围绕“歌曲”这一主题撰写专栏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1045_008tak", "source_sha256": "b5d0a3b6f078ee0d2311d71b710f825716668d5940d0b81f23df2fe4a85cf377", "ja": "こらむ……私達が、自らの思いを綴るのですね。", "zh": "专栏……是要我们亲自写下自己的心情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1046_p", "source_sha256": "973bb41b0080b2b59339ba8cf67f484d60871548e6bed8e59752e65baa7ec120", "ja": "ああ。それぞれ、『歌』について考えている事を、\n素直に書いてもらうのがいいと思ってる。", "zh": "啊。我想，还是让大家分别坦率地写下自己对“歌”的想法比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1047_002chi", "source_sha256": "dd454bfec0921c638430512fc1dc64bdb22d58fe902039a43bf88b5764fa1910", "ja": "歌への思い……。素直にと言われても、難しいです。\n自分の心に、あらためて向き合って……。", "zh": "对歌的想法……就算让我坦率地写出来，也很困难。\n得重新面对自己的内心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1048_008tak", "source_sha256": "5e23454bcb14b90e8e77794b442edab6c4a45e241d6cb640f61d0881575fa7a4", "ja": "ですが、そうした雑誌の記事は、私達のことを\n知っていただく良い機会になりそうですね。", "zh": "不过，那些杂志上的报道，似乎会成为让大家了解我们的好机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1049_010azu", "source_sha256": "1ef8f9759954c308fde5c39eac7c16495f08ae7a90c06ad342a11027068dd7b0", "ja": "歌についての、思い……。", "zh": "关于歌曲的想法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_02_1050_010azu", "source_sha256": "1f12f082ee02529099b68f8eb0d29a2dc1dc9ffaa421ec8faaadd6564d9c0da4", "ja": "そうですね……ちょっと、難しそうですけど。\nでも、考えてみますね。", "zh": "是啊……好像有点难。\n不过，我会试着想想看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
